   "body": "The Caldrian Monetary Authority held the policy rate at 4.50%. Members noted inflation easing toward target and signalled that gradual reductions are possible over the next year if the labour market cools. The market-implied path is published daily as the cma_futures series (contract price = 100 - expected policy rate).",
